# Deny by default. This repo is rooted at the Windows user profile, so any
# unlisted file - credentials, tokens, kube/docker/cloud config - stays out
# of git. Add an explicit "!" line to track something new.
*

# Explicitly tracked:
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!requirements.txt

# Previously-tracked ADB public key (harmless, kept for continuity):
!.android/
.android/*
!.android/adbkey.pub

# Action Package source. Un-exclude the directory first - git will not descend
# into an excluded directory, so the "!dir/" line has to precede "!dir/**".
!actions/
!actions/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# ...but never the generated noise inside them. These come last so they win:
# the last matching pattern decides.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Action Server working directories:
**/.datadir/
**/devdata/
**/output/
**/.devrun/
**/*.zip
